              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.47.1+ISA.47.2+ISA.47.3+ISA.47.4+ISA.47.5+ISA.47.6+ISA.47.7+ISA.47.8+ISA.47.9+ISA.47.10+ISA.47.11+ISA.47.12+ISA.47.13+ISA.47.14+ISA.47.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 47.1-15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "Yer 50.1—51.64",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kunini d'aamsa lafa Babiloni ka AABBO Waaqi Isaya ilma Amoziti d'aame. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kubi qulqulliti ira baandera d'aaba! Askartiti lalaba, harka keesani oliqaba, akheekha garsiisa, aka worri balbala dira worra gugurdaa had'u. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi yayu askarti jajanna filatani ga yaame, aka worri d'ufe, worra inni iti dallane had'e balleesu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyyaana gaara iraa d'uftu ch'aqasa — qonqo gumi guddo, gosa heddu wolti baate. Waaqi abba duulaa duula ufii had'iisaa kurfeesu jira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri lafa fago ta muumme lafati d'ufuu jira. AABBO Waaqi dallansu ufitini lafa ch'ufa balleesu d'ufa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOL.1.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoe 1.15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laalefad'a, boha! Guyyaani AABBO Waaqaa yayu d'iaate, guyyaani Waaqi guddaani lafa balleesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nama ch'ufa harki iraa bue, garaalleeni aka male laafa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami ch'ufa mudame, aka hama laalefate d'ukubsate, akuma nad'eeni d'alaa ch'ininfattu taha. Worri ch'ufti ila sodaatiini woli ilaale, aka male woli mudamsiisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Guyyaani AABBO Waaqa d'ufuu jira — guyyaani hamani inni aka male dallanu. Lafti ch'ufti aloo taate, nama ch'ubbu ch'ufa balleesani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.32.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Eze 32.7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.24.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 24.29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.13.24+MRK.13.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mar 13.24-25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.21.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 21.25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.6.12+REV.6.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mul 6.12-13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Urjini ch'ufti ifsu lakifte, aduuleeni hojja gabaatu dukanoofte, jiileeni ifsu dida.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi waan jed'u, Anini baddi lafatini d'ufe, nama ch'ubbu qabu ch'ufa maro ch'ubbu isaanitifi gaargalcha. Anini kiyyiba ch'ufa d'owe, nama hamama ufi olifuud'ule gaargalcha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini nama lafa irati diqeese, diqeenna worqi ka lafa iraatini woli fakeesa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anini gubba hargufe, laftileeni chochoote, fulla ufiti deemti, guyya anini, AABBO Waaqi guddaani, gugubad'e dallanu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Keessumaani lafa Babiloni keesa jirtu lafa ufiti baqatti akuma hiddini nama had'u duraa baqattu, yokhaani aka hooliye tissitu inqamne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nama qabani ch'ufa goraadeeni ijeesani, sheeftiini hobaasani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ila worraa durati, ilmaani worraa ch'ach'arasani hobaasani, maneeni worraa saamani, nad'eeni worrale buufatani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi waan jed'u, Anini gosa Medi kaase, worra Babiloni haasisa. Worri sunini qarsi iyyaalu yokhaani worqile imfed'u. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri t'iyaani kaima fit'e, ijoollele ch'ufaa nahu dida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.19.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Uum 19.24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lafti Babiloni lafa ch'ufa ira mid'aadu, mid'aaguma isii suni nami isii ch'ufti mataani d'aaba. Ammo anini, AABBO Waaqi, akuma Sodomafi Gomora balleese Babilonile balleesa! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami tokoleeni deebie lafa suni keesa intahu; Araftini tokoleeni waaro ufii achiti ind'aabatu. Tissituuni tokoleeni hori achiti intissitu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.34.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 34.14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ZEP.2.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Sef 2.14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.18.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mul 18.2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lafti sunini fulla bineensi alaa iti gale, urunguni mana iti jaaratu taati. Guchini achiti galte, reeni abba inqamne ona suni keesa buraat'i. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worabeesi doofi isii jajabdu keesaa yuuse, sareeni diida maneeni isi, guuti. Guyyaani Babiloni ya gahe! Guyyaani isii ya ala hobae.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.13.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aka worri boojiani galu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
